uctured task packs, IA, assets, deployment planning, diagrams, and the “super entry” decision.","chunks":[],"finished":true},{"summary":"Assessed file access and planned sources","content":"","chunks":[],"finished":true}],"source_analysis_msg_id":"2c8c2a40-c9bb-4fdf-97ca-a46ad490a4f3"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"652e1233-18b2-49d6-8281-cdf471d1b2bb","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1790754969.901322,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"thoughts","thoughts":[{"summary":"整理商业级前端交付方案","content":"我正在把方案收敛为一份中文交付文档：用标题、表格、列表和一张 Mermaid 图组织内容，覆盖三项目的完成度、IA、页面状态、资产清单、动效、无障碍、Windows 打包、测试与部署。由于当前没有可核验的图片来源，我将专注于清晰、可执行的文字与结构。","chunks":[],"finished":true},{"summary":"整理商业级前端交付方案","content":"","chunks":[],"finished":true}],"source_analysis_msg_id":"20333c44-e424-4745-be1b-7a8786146f47"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"fd94dd74-166d-439d-8649-ded58d0bc420","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1790755108.802574,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":"Worked for 6m 49s"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"reasoning_ended"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"7d5cac10-ed6b-519e-a7a1-2f2c3c3d2a9e","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":null,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":""},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":0.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Generated report on 执行摘要"},"recipient":"all","channel":null}],"source_searches":[]}